a character on ''Days of Our Lives''?","options":[{"id":"a","text":"Dr. Mark Sloan","is_correct":false},{"id":"b","text":"Dr. Drake Ramoray","is_correct":true},{"id":"c","text":"Dr. Drake Richards","is_correct":false},{"id":"d","text":"Dr. Ross Geller","is_correct":false}],"explanation":"Joey plays neurosurgeon Dr. Drake Ramoray — until the writers kill the character off."},{"id":"q7","question":"According to the running gag, what does Chandler do for a living?","options":[{"id":"a","text":"He''s an accountant","is_correct":false},{"id":"b","text":"He''s a ''transponster''","is_correct":false},{"id":"c","text":"Statistical analysis and data reconfiguration","is_correct":true},{"id":"d","text":"He''s a corporate lawyer","is_correct":false}],"explanation":"Nobody can name it — Monica''s guess ''transponster'' costs them the apartment. His real title is statistical analysis and data reconfiguration."},{"id":"q8","question":"How many seasons did Friends run?","options":[{"id":"a","text":"8","is_correct":false},{"id":"b","text":"11","is_correct":false},{"id":"c","text":"12","is_correct":false},{"id":"d","text":"10","is_correct":true}],"explanation":"Ten seasons and 236 episodes, from 1994 to 2004."}]'::jsonb,
  null,
