rect":false},{"id":"c","text":"V-Bucks","is_correct":true},{"id":"d","text":"Crown Coins","is_correct":false}],"explanation":"V-Bucks buy skins, emotes and the Battle Pass; Robux is Roblox''s currency."},{"id":"q7","question":"What is the name of the shrinking zone that pushes players together?","options":[{"id":"a","text":"The Circle","is_correct":false},{"id":"b","text":"The Wall","is_correct":false},{"id":"c","text":"The Surge","is_correct":false},{"id":"d","text":"The Storm","is_correct":true}],"explanation":"The Storm shrinks the safe zone and drains the health of anyone caught outside."},{"id":"q8","question":"Which wandering creature is stuffed with extra loot and materials?","options":[{"id":"a","text":"The Loot Goat","is_correct":false},{"id":"b","text":"The Supply Llama","is_correct":true},{"id":"c","text":"The Treasure Horse","is_correct":false},{"id":"d","text":"The Loot Alpaca","is_correct":false}],"explanation":"Supply Llamas roam the map full of materials, ammo and healing items."}]'::jsonb,
